WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:03.042
I worry that
we're all kind of disconnected.

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:04.250
Did you ask me something?

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.750
-What?
-It's fine.

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:07.167
-Okay. Good night.
-Good night.

00:00:08.792 --> 00:00:10.958
CC, do you think
it's good for you to live like this?

00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:12.000
Heads up.

00:00:12.958 --> 00:00:14.292
Not supposed to use your hands.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.417
Wyatt, family meeting downstairs.
Let's go!

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.833
Can you help me with this problem?

00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:21.042
-I'm kidding. You can't help me.
-No, I can't.

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:24.417
We are gonna make
a happy memory as a family.

00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:29.250
I wish you could be me.

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:31.500
I would love for you
to be me for one day.

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:33.167
I'd love for you to be me.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:36.042
I'd kill to eat a dozen doughnuts
and just have it burn right off.

00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:38.083
Would you take a picture
of my family, please?

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:41.875
Everybody say, "Merry Christmas."

00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:54.333
-What are you doing in my bed?
-You're in my bed.

00:00:54.417 --> 00:00:57.125
-Why am I in your bed, Mom?
-Why am I in your bed, Dad?

00:00:58.292 --> 00:00:59.458
What is happening?

00:00:59.542 --> 00:01:00.375
That's me.

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:02.458
-CC?
-Mom?

00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:03.458
Wyatt?

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.333
Dad?

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:10.583
This is a situation
that has never happened before.

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:11.667
I'm 17 again.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.708
-I'm 13 going on 30.
-So freaky.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.917
What's wrong with Pickles?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.167
What's going on with Miles?

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.542
Pickles is Miles.

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:23.833
We just need to get through today
and figure out how this happened.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.458
Your dad happens to be the toast,
and high school's kinda my jam.

00:01:26.542 --> 00:01:28.292
You stole my first kiss?

00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:29.833
No! I… pulled away.

00:01:29.917 --> 00:01:32.458
-You rejected Ariana?!
-God! Dad!

00:01:32.542 --> 00:01:34.750
I can't believe
I thought we could pull this off.

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.625
-Be a boss. Uh-huh?
-Be a boss. Uh-huh.

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:38.250
Be a boss.

00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:39.833
Be a boss.

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:50.750
Sounds like you need
to fix what is broken.

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:54.250
We've got this. We're Walkers,
and Walkers never quit.

00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:55.958
Cramps! Ow!

00:01:56.042 --> 00:01:57.167
I think I tore a quadi.

00:01:58.042 --> 00:02:00.958
More than anything,
I just want you to be okay.

00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:02.458
We have 24 hours.

00:02:02.542 --> 00:02:05.458
If we don't figure this out,
we'll be stuck like this forever.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.208
This is the most exciting thing
I've done in years.

00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:10.833
Whatever happens,
we'll get through it together.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.750
This is just a dream.
And we have to wake up. Slap me.

00:02:20.208 --> 00:02:21.333
I think the dog and the baby

00:02:21.417 --> 00:02:23.417
are spending
too much time together.

